- [x] Deliberate differences declared, not tolerated — `migration-scripts/divergences.config.mjs`
- [x] 44 of 93 pages structurally identical
- [ ] The other 49 — all tour, area, tag and category pages, one root cause below

### The one remaining defect: conditional regions

- [ ] `tpl-tour` is missing the **highlights**, **pricing notes** and **cancellation policy** regions, so those three fields have nowhere to render on any tour page

- [ ] Same class of gap on the area, tag and category templates

Webflow omits a conditional region **entirely** when its condition is off, so a region absent from the sample item is absent from the frozen template for every page. And no single tour has all three: `rotorua-one-day-tour` has the pricing section, `black-water-rafting-tour-1-day` has the cancellation policy, neither has both.

So "pick the sample that renders the most" is not sufficient here — the template has to be assembled from more than one sample, or the regions driven per item. That is the next piece of work and it is well understood.

